{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-10","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a number be parts of a number, and another be the same parts of another, alternately also, whatever parts or part the first is of the third, the same parts or the same part will the second also be of the fourth.","book":7,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-10@raw-502042f8cb50a182","contentId":"euclid-7-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"502042f8cb50a182baee9428f4dc74065f8c60dfaa9fda4b2ba7441565b08dd7","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-10.statement","euclid-7-10.construction.1","euclid-7-10.proof.1","euclid-7-10.construction.2","euclid-7-10.proof.2","euclid-7-10.conclusion","euclid-7-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-10","revisionId":"euclid-7-10@raw-502042f8cb50a182","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c28d8f13db20440a42495a5ff808006ed940ddfbc8a9cc9edb68926d4dba924d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number be parts of a number, and another be the same parts of another, alternately also, whatever parts or part the first is of the third, the same parts or the same part will the second also be of the fourth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果数字的一部分是数字的一部分,而另一个是数字的相同部分,则无论第一部分或一部分是第三个部分,同一部分或同一部分也是第四个部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-10","revisionId":"euclid-7-10@raw-502042f8cb50a182","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1e4298913b421349eb4af095783e57deb8f701e644367142d4cbb4ead4483768","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number AB be parts of the number C, and another, DE, the same parts of another, F; I say that, alternately also, whatever parts or part AB is of DE, the same parts or the same part is C of F also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB数字是C数字的一部分,另外DE数字是F数字的一部分;我说,换句话说,无论AB部件或第AB零件是DE,F零件或同一部分也是C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-10","revisionId":"euclid-7-10@raw-502042f8cb50a182","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0768e8e7e854df14a54c442471c928d27490bd374b570055f0a13028dd972f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, whatever parts AB is of C, the same parts also is DE of F, therefore, as many parts of C as there are in AB, so many parts also of F are there in DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,无论AB部分为C部分,F部分中也有DE部分,因此,C部分与AB部分相同,DE部分中也有F部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-10.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-10","revisionId":"euclid-7-10@raw-502042f8cb50a182","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"326b7331c1670a42614349bed91d64b1011657bb5c3a103e6d5de63692e3b35c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be divided into the parts of C, namely AG, GB, and DE into the parts of F, namely DH, HE; thus the multitude of AG, GB will be equal to the multitude of DH, HE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB分为C,即AG、GB和DE,即F,即DH、HE;因此,AG、GB将相当于DH、HE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-10","revisionId":"euclid-7-10@raw-502042f8cb50a182","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0d947665d319f89c404d42699a8bafff467c5cfb4ba8604ec3471119c02dffa","citations":["euclid-7-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, whatever part AG is of C, the same part also is DH of F, alternately also, whatever part or parts AG is of DH, the same part or the same parts is C of F also. [[VII. 9](/principles/euclid-7-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,无论第AG部分是C部分,同一部分也是F部分中的DH部分,而不论第AG部分是DH部分,同一部分或相同部分也是F部分中的C部分。 [[VII. 9](/principles/euclid-7-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-10","revisionId":"euclid-7-10@raw-502042f8cb50a182","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2b66bfc01b7192c54a793e02a6050c1d7970fb39c76fce6c590dfda62a1bee49","citations":["euclid-7-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, whatever part or parts GB is of HE, the same part or the same parts is C of F also; so that, in addition, whatever parts or part AB is of DE, the same parts also, or the same part, is C of F. [[VII. 5, 6](/principles/euclid-7-5)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,无论GB部分或HE部分是多少,F部分或相同部分也是C部分;因此,无论AB部分或部分是DE部分,F部分或相同部分也是C部分。 [[VII. 5, 6](/principles/euclid-7-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-10.source","contentId":"euclid-7-10","revisionId":"euclid-7-10@raw-502042f8cb50a182","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13ed8274308d007751bfbb7a7a2bcf9dba13f058647e913d90bee18a636953ac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-10:euclid-7-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-10.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"VII. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-10:euclid-7-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-10.conclusion"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"VII. 5, 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-10:euclid-7-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-10","sourceBlockIds":[],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"VII. 5, 6"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-13:euclid-7-10:explicit","sourc